    Bug Fix V4.06: fixed a bug where GKupload was putting the sysops name
    as the uploader and not the person who uploaded it. Now fixed. Fixed a
    problem where if file had no filenote but a *.Desc file the filenote
    wasn't being written to disk. Now fixed.

    Bug Fix V4.02: with the fix for V4.01 I accidently added another bug I
    forgot to reinitialize a variable. Now fixed.

    Bug Fix V4.01: 2 things fixed in this version I found that the program
    wasn't writing filenotes correctly this has now been fixed also fixed
    a related problem which happened because if a .desc file had no long
    description there was no descriptiom being placed  in the full list
    now fixed.

    Bug Fix V4.00: So many changes and fixes that I can't remember them
    all. I found that if you didn't use uppercase for the overnight switch
    that it failed now fixed. It appears that if using the overnight
    switch that it wasn't putting the default comment against any files
    that it found without a comment. Now fixed.. 

    Bug Fix V3.10: It seems I did it again I added some new features and
    while I wasn't looking a bug crept in Don't worry about what it was
    but suffice to say it is now fixed..

    Bug fix V3.08: reinitialized variable a = while in a loop of this name
    and script failed to complete its mission sorry now fixed.

    Bug Reported in V3.08: blank lines in full list caused by description
    files am investigating will fix.

    Bug fix V3.08: Well guess what happened no sooner had I uploaded V3.07
    to the TransAmiga support board here in Melbourne and I found a bug
    sorry guys it turns out that if you create your own .desc file for a
    particular archive that TransAmiga names these a particular way ie.
    .Desc notice the upper case 'D' oh well you live and learn. have now
    fixed this. note that this is only a problem if you create your own
    description file for an archive. BTW the .desc file I included in the
    archive had the wrong extension this was how I found the problem.

    Bug fix V3.07: fixed a problem in the ANSI routine of the full list
    removed all ansi for until a fix can be found. Rewrote code that
    outputs files optimised them for quicker writes.

    Known Bug in all Versions:  If the description file has tabs in it
    then for some reason the full list will not show correctly in
    Directory Opus. I am not sure if this is a bug in Opus or not. I will
    investigate in the near future, in the meantime to fix this problem
    edit the offending .desc file to remove any tabs this will correct the
    problem.

    Bug fix V3.05: Fixed a bug when if you dont supply the -L argument the
    program trys to copy a file that doesn't exist now corrected.

    Bug fix V3.06: Removed line with New files in output files.bbs as
    it was incompatible with filescroller.
    fixed a bug where if a file didn't have an extension it didn't get
    processed by GKupload should be OK now.

